{"4998510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nookmaker", "steam_appid": 4998510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make a space that feels like yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nookmaker is a cozy decorating game about small rooms and slow afternoons. Pick a space, open the catalogue, and start placing. A reading chair by the window. Plants on the sill. Books stacked however you like them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arrange freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, rotate, and place objects wherever you want them. Nothing snaps you into a grid you didn't choose, and nothing is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fill it with things you love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse a growing catalogue of furniture, plants, lighting, and small clutter. The details that make a room look lived in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No pressure, ever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no scores, no failing. Put on some music, take your time, and stop when the room feels right.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make a space that feels like yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nookmaker is a cozy decorating game about small rooms and slow afternoons. Pick a space, open the catalogue, and start placing. A reading chair by the window. Plants on the sill. Books stacked however you like them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arrange freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, rotate, and place objects wherever you want them. Nothing snaps you into a grid you didn't choose, and nothing is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fill it with things you love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse a growing catalogue of furniture, plants, lighting, and small clutter. The details that make a room look lived in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No pressure, ever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no scores, no failing. Put on some music, take your time, and stop when the room feels right.</p>", "short_description": "Decorate cozy little rooms exactly how you want them. Arrange furniture, play with light and texture, and build a space that feels like yours. No timers, no fail states, just you and a room to make beautiful.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998510/a8a7de0684c989d6764cfc84a4a5046017175452/header.jpg?t=1788111474", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998510/9d86853fa75618317d6ee80de0531776bc86569a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788111474", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4998510/9d86853fa75618317d6ee80de0531776bc86569a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788111474", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 620 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Day Trip Games"], "publishers": ["Day Trip Games"], "package_groups": [], "platf